m  part 4 yukako Trish prosuto and pesky  giaccio FF and Diego also ikuro  hashizawa is back which newer JoJo fans  may not be familiar with and that's  because he exists outside the universe  but is another creation of hirohiko  araki and it's nice that he's back  because he was in the original roster so  fans of the predecessor don't worry your  favorite bio weapon is still there of  course all the characters are available  from the get-go so any aspiring or  current fighting Esports players can get  a feel for them before they take it to  the tournament you can totally play as  Paul Nero's best friend Iggy in his epic  battle with pet shop now  of course all these characters have  different styles that come on where you  can charge your HH altimeter vampirism  stand  ing there are also others like mounted  for diesel and Johnny  Olga Street for Speedwagon  watch it  later and of course bow arm phenomenon  for ikuru hashizawa a lot of the  original voice actors or CU and you're  one say in the case of Jordan Cujo who  is now voiced by Fire's eye instead of  Miyuki saloshiro have redone their voice  lines and they all sound so much more  comfortable in their roles after all  these years so mad respect for the voice  actors were coming back and re-recording  your lines you guys are awesome and the  fans love them  also the character models now closely  reflect the ones in the anime so that's  even more juicy Joe Jonas to bite into  it is a beautiful game with Rich visuals  amazing voice acting and tons of  abilities to learn and master if you are  a JoJo fan you need to get your hands on  a copy anyway if any of you out there  have any questions leave them in the  comment section down below and I'll do  my best to get to them and I'll catch  you soon take care foreign  [Music]  [Music]  [Applause]

